{
"segs": [
{
"text": "You just woke up with a penguin in your bathtub.",
"start": 0.06,
"end": 2.26275,
"w0": 0
},
{
"text": "It's real, it's angry, and your landlord inspects the flat at nine in the morning.",
"start": 2.56275,
"end": 6.956083333333334,
"w0": 10
},
{
"text": "Building rule number one: no pets. No exceptions.",
"start": 7.076083333333334,
"end": 9.969916666666666,
"w0": 25
},
{
"text": "That gives you twelve hours to make a penguin disappear.",
"start": 10.189916666666667,
"end": 13.138375,
"w0": 33
},
{
"text": "Problem one: it's starving. A penguin eats about half a kilo of fish a day.",
"start": 13.488375,
"end": 17.8505,
"w0": 43
},
{
"text": "Your fridge has one lemon and some ketchup.",
"start": 17.9705,
"end": 20.408625,
"w0": 58
},
{
"text": "So at one in the morning, you buy every tin of sardines in the shop. The cashier doesn't ask. You don't explain.",
"start": 20.628625,
"end": 26.808625,
"w0": 66
},
{
"text": "Problem two: the noise. This is an African penguin, and its nickname is the jackass penguin, because it calls exactly like a donkey.",
"start": 27.058625,
"end": 34.719833333333334,
"w0": 88
},
{
"text": "At three in the morning, it starts calling.",
"start": 34.83983333333333,
"end": 36.84254166666666,
"w0": 111
},
{
"text": "Your neighbour bangs on the wall. Why is there a donkey in there?",
"start": 36.96254166666666,
"end": 40.235499999999995,
"w0": 119
},
{
"text": "So you get smart. You blast a nature documentary, so the donkey noises have an alibi.",
"start": 40.455499999999994,
"end": 45.62908333333333,
"w0": 132
},
{
"text": "Except now the penguin thinks the TV is another penguin, and it's calling back. Louder.",
"start": 45.749083333333324,
"end": 50.87566666666666,
"w0": 148
},
{
"text": "Problem three: penguins don't aim. They can launch their poop more than a metre.",
"start": 51.17566666666666,
"end": 55.226541666666655,
"w0": 163
},
{
"text": "Your bathroom has a new wall colour.",
"start": 55.34654166666665,
"end": 57.23558333333332,
"w0": 177
},
{
"text": "At five, you finally read the band on its flipper. City Zoo. Number forty-seven.",
"start": 57.535583333333314,
"end": 62.18141666666665,
"w0": 184
},
{
"text": "Then your phone buzzes. Breaking news: penguin stolen from City Zoo. Police are checking the car park cameras.",
"start": 62.30141666666665,
"end": 69.03795833333331,
"w0": 198
},
{
"text": "You don't remember last night. But your car keys are in the bathtub.",
"start": 69.15795833333331,
"end": 72.72520833333331,
"w0": 216
},
{
"text": "Eight fifty-seven. Three knocks. Your landlord is early.",
"start": 73.22520833333331,
"end": 76.26820833333332,
"w0": 229
},
{
"text": "You can hide the penguin, or you can tell the truth.",
"start": 76.56820833333332,
"end": 79.12716666666665,
"w0": 237
},
{
"text": "Comment hide or truth, and follow, because the most-liked answer decides part two.",
"start": 79.24716666666666,
"end": 84.18633333333332,
"w0": 248
}
],
